# v20-v24: All generated output dirs are TRACKED in git
# (they're the canonical releases of each pipeline stage). Don't ignore them.
# Per-harness gitignores only apply to truly ephemeral state (logs, idb).

# v25 unified structure analysis (fwstruct): outputs ARE canonical, tracked.
# Re-generated with `bin/fwstruct scan structs callgraph magic initpath diff`
# or by reading from v19/decompiled/. Don't gitignore.
# Core dumps & scratch
*.core
scratch/
tmp/
